{
  "name": "TestTagWritesPairsOntoCurrentCall",
  "comment": "debug.tag attaches Tags to the running goal's frame (%!call.Scope%), which lives for the goal's run — the tag step's own frames pop when the step ends — so a later step reads them there.",
